<title>JAPAN: Shinanen bid-only on share buy-back plan.</title>
<headline>Shinanen bid-only on share buy-back plan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Shinanen Co Ltd, a petroleum products maker, were bid-only on Tuesday morning, helped by its plan announced on Friday to buy back up to 4.5 million of its own shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0137 GMT, the share price was bid-only at 640 yen, above its Friday closing price of 600 yen. Financial markets were closed on Monday for a national holiday.</p>
</text>
